note A condition in a contract may call only pure functions (no `uses`).
note Expected diagnostic: `is_reachable` uses `network`, so it cannot be called in `expect`.
function is_reachable(host: Text, network: Network) -> Bool
    uses network
    return ping(host, network)

function connect(host: Text, network: Network) -> Connection
    expect is_reachable(host, network)
    uses network
    return open_connection(host, network)
